\f2\b0\fs26 \cf0 \strokec2 # AI WhatsApp Sales & Support Assistant\
## Complete Implementation Guide for Claude Code\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55356 \u57263  Project Overview\
\
You are building a **Progressive Web App (PWA)** that enables small businesses to automate WhatsApp customer support using AI. The system consists of:\
- **Frontend**: React PWA dashboard for business owners\
- **Backend**: Node.js/Express API with Google ADK orchestration\
- **Database**: PostgreSQL with TypeORM\
- **AI**: Claude Sonnet 4.5 for conversational responses\
- **Document Search**: Google File Search API for knowledge retrieval\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55356 \u57303 \u65039  Architecture Pattern\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 Customer WhatsApp \uc0\u8594  WhatsApp API Webhook \u8594  Backend API \u8595  Google ADK Agent (Orchestrator) \u8595  \u9484 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9532 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9488  \u8595  \u8595  \u8595  Claude AI Google File Search PostgreSQL DB (Response Gen) (Doc Retrieval) (Context/Data) \u8595  \u8595  \u8595  \u9492 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9532 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9496  \u8595  Response to Customer \u8595  Business Owner Dashboard (Monitor & Control)
