\cf0 \strokec2 ---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56550  Technology Stack\
\
### **Frontend**\
- **Framework**: React 18+ with TypeScript\
- **Build Tool**: Vite\
- **Styling**: TailwindCSS v3+\
- **State Management**: React Query (TanStack Query) + Zustand\
- **Routing**: React Router v6\
- **HTTP Client**: Axios\
- **WebSocket**: Socket.io-client (real-time updates)\
- **PWA**: Workbox (service worker)\
- **UI Components**: Headless UI + Custom components\
\
### **Backend**\
- **Runtime**: Node.js 20+\
- **Framework**: Express.js\
- **Language**: TypeScript\
- **ORM**: TypeORM\
- **Database**: PostgreSQL 15+\
- **Queue**: BullMQ with Redis (for cron jobs)\
- **Validation**: Zod\
- **Authentication**: JWT (jsonwebtoken)\
- **Logging**: Winston\
- **Testing**: Jest\
\
### **External Services**\
- **AI**: Anthropic Claude API (claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929)\
- **WhatsApp**: Twilio WhatsApp Business API (or Meta Cloud API)\
- **File Search**: Google File Search API\
- **Orchestration**: Google ADK (Agentic Development Kit)\
- **Storage**: Google Drive (for business documents)\
- **Hosting**: Railway/Render (backend), Vercel (frontend)\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56593  Core Implementation Principles\
\
### **1. Google ADK Agent Pattern**\
\
**Reference**: Use the `google-adk-ai-agent-builder-v20` skill installed in your Claude environment.\
\
**Agent Configuration**:\
```typescript\
// Pseudo-code structure for Google ADK Agent\
\
Agent: WhatsAppSalesAssistant \{\
  name: "WhatsApp Sales & Support Agent",\
  model: "claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929",\
  \
  tools: [\
    \{\
      name: "file_search",\
      description: "Search business documents in Google Drive",\
      parameters: \{ query: string, business_id: string \}\
    \},\
    \{\
      name: "product_lookup",\
      description: "Query product catalog from database",\
      parameters: \{ search_term: string, business_id: string \}\
    \},\
    \{\
      name: "send_whatsapp_message",\
      description: "Send message to customer via WhatsApp",\
      parameters: \{ to: string, message: string \}\
    \},\
    \{\
      name: "escalate_to_human",\
      description: "Alert business owner to take over conversation",\
      parameters: \{ conversation_id: string, reason: string \}\
    \}\
  ],\
  \
  workflow: \{\
    steps: [\
      "receive_message",\
      "load_conversation_context",\
      "classify_intent",\
      "gather_information", // File Search + DB queries\
      "generate_response", // Claude AI\
      "confidence_check",\
      "send_or_escalate"\
    ]\
  \},\
  \
  confidence_threshold: 0.85,\
  \
  system_prompt: `\
    You are an AI assistant for \{business_name\}.\
    Tone: \{ai_tone\}\
    Business Context: \{products\}, \{policies\}, \{location\}\
    Conversation History: \{last_5_messages\}\
    Retrieved Documents: \{file_search_results\}\
    \
    Respond naturally and helpfully. If unsure, escalate to the owner.\
  `\
\}\
